        <activityName xml:lang="en">Refrigerant collector</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Refrigerant collector
This data set describes the production of a refrigerant collector from literature source. Data regarding to production (energy use, working materials, waste) stems from company data, requirements of half-finished products from literature. Transport distances are estimated.;
UUID: 05167a56-30ce-3f7e-8cbe-2fec931c9370
This data set describes the production of a refrigerant collector including energy use, use of semi-finished products and working materials, waste treatment and transports of components.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Collector made of construction steel
Time period: The literature source from 1999 uses company specific of year 1999.
Production volume: na
Sampling: literature 
Extrapolations: no extrapolations
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_05167a56-30ce-3f7e-8cbe-2fec931c9370.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
